#: ../../source/conventions.rst:2 211018e2f1944080ba96936aaf10938f
msgid "_`Convention alignment`"
msgstr "_`约定对齐`"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:4 c4e44014880947e988e3e23de7f997db
msgid "This page is the **precondition** for comparing anything against an external reference — another FOC implementation, a bench measurement, or an offline model. Angle frames, rotation direction, units and clamping style must agree *before* any RMSE or overshoot number is computed; otherwise the comparison measures the conventions, not the algorithm."
msgstr "本页是 **任何比对的前置条件** ——无论对照的是另一份 FOC 实现、台架实测还是离线模型。角度、旋转方向、单位制与钳位方式必须先对齐，否则算出来的 RMSE/超调衡量的是约定差异，不是算法。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:9 74fae18a7f414023830b8da47d1509c5
msgid "The conventions below are not a preference: they are whatever :code:`include/foc/` already implements. Any reference has to align to them, never the other way round."
msgstr "下面的口径不是偏好，而是 :code:`include/foc/` 已经实现的事实；任何参考都要向这里对齐，反过来不行。"

