#: ../../source/conventions.rst:84 5bcda654457d4425a83ce3b44372b68a
msgid "_`2. The four traps that actually bite`"
msgstr "_`2. 对齐时最容易出错的四条`"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:86 b608d5995e904a2dbd4baa156a10b878
msgid "**Mechanical vs electrical angle.** A missing :code:`pole_pairs` makes the whole dq frame rotate at :math:`1/p` of the right speed; the symptom is \"the current loop never catches up\". :code:`PlantHal::advance()` and :code:`PlantPosition` must use one conversion, not two."
msgstr "**机械 vs 电角度** ：漏乘 :code:`pole_pairs` 会让整个 dq 系以 :math:`1/p` 的速度旋转，表现是“电流环怎么调都跟不上”。 :code:`PlantHal::advance()` 与 :code:`PlantPosition` 必须用同一套换算。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:89 ca142194496a4b3c90026a45d9e290c3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Amplitude-invariant vs power-invariant Clarke.** A power-invariant Clarke (with :math:`\\sqrt{2/3}`) scales :math:`|i_{\\alpha\\beta}|` by :math:`\\sqrt{3/2}` — \"1 A commanded, 1.22 A delivered\". A closed loop hides this: the integrator quietly absorbs the gain error, so only an open-loop comparison exposes it."
msgstr "**幅值不变式 vs 功率不变式** ：功率不变式 Clarke（带 :math:`\\sqrt{2/3}` ）会让 :math:`|i_{\\alpha\\beta}|` 差 :math:`\\sqrt{3/2}` ——“给定 1 A 实际 1.22 A”；闭环会把这个增益误差悄悄补掉，只有开环比对才看得见。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:93 d0407971de8a48228bdc0fc2ad0a196f
msgid "**Stationary vs rotating zero-order hold.** A real inverter pins the voltage vector in the *stationary* frame for the whole PWM period. Holding it in the dq frame (re-parking every sub-step) adds a spurious zero-order-hold error at speed. Both the C++ plant and the arbiter use the stationary frame."
msgstr "**静止系保持 vs 旋转系保持** ：真实逆变器在整个 PWM 周期把电压矢量钉在 **静止** 系；按 dq 系保持（每子步重新 park）在高速时等效于额外的零阶保持误差。本项目 C++ 侧与仲裁侧都按静止系处理。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:97 de99e38297354958bd9efe90ca17d15d
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid "**The ramp trap in steady-state error.** On a speed ramp the current loop always lags by :math:`e = \\dot{E}MF / k_i` (about 1 % here). That is not a defect: before judging \"steady-state error\", confirm the run is on a constant-speed segment."
msgstr "**稳态误差的“斜坡陷阱”** ：转速斜坡上电流环必然有 :math:`e = \\dot{E}MF / k_i` 的跟随偏差（本机约 1%），这不是缺陷；判“稳态误差”前先确认处于匀速段。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:102 c6c20b2a96c841399d14a992449269f9
msgid "_`3. Extra checks before comparing with a third party`"
msgstr "_`3. 与外部参考比对的额外检查项`"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:109 f919d3a3abcb4866be8defe4ec034fea
