#, python-brace-format
msgid "per-unit or SI; if per-unit, what are :math:`V_{base}`, :math:`I_{base}`, :math:`\\omega_{base}`"
msgstr "标幺还是 SI；若标幺， :math:`V_{base}` 、 :math:`I_{base}` 、 :math:`\\omega_{base}` 各是多少"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:116 63232e601ecc42de8c36fb53b6595446
msgid "PI anti-windup"
msgstr "PI 抗饱和"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:117 122666779029469f80775860b3e25242
msgid "present or not, and how: clamping / back-calculation / conditional integration"
msgstr "有无、何种方式：钳位 / back-calculation / 条件积分"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:119 aeaf345ee6b540dd9867ddcc2f52d0a6
msgid "seven-segment or five-segment; over-modulation or not; per-phase or vector clamping"
msgstr "七段式还是五段式；有无过调制；钳位是逐相还是矢量"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:120 1ab254d33fc645ee8e6f498f67bd2c5b
msgid "Sampling and delay"
