#: ../../source/conventions.rst:121 b55b03b7d2ab4dbe9640e1e7b47cae6a
msgid "one-period computation delay? mid-point sampling? loop rate versus PWM frequency?"
msgstr "是否有 1 拍计算延迟；是否中点采样；控制器更新率与 PWM 频率的关系"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:124 af9b324fff8f4ba9a9476a3921bddfe4
msgid "_`4. Status of the SguanFOC reference`"
msgstr "_`4. SguanFOC（第三层参考）的状态`"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:126 722994ea21f44c02bde85f5a1cdd8813
msgid "**Not vendored, not built, not in any CI path.**"
msgstr "**未 vendor、未构建、不参与任何 CI** 。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:127 a28be654eff54e3291a26cadd39f12a1
msgid "Upstream is a single-maintainer project whose licence and long-term maintenance were never audited."
msgstr "上游是个人主导项目，许可与长期维护性未经审计。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:129 e5ed3de9363a403a9bf946165f66fde6
msgid "Vendoring a snapshot (pinned commit) means putting third-party code into this repository — licence, size and maintenance are all affected, so it is an architecture-level decision that belongs to the repository owner. Until such a decision exists, sections 1 and 3 above are the only valid reference."
msgstr "vendor 快照（锁定 commit）意味着把第三方代码放进本库仓库——许可、体积与维护都会受影响，属于 **架构级决策** ，留给仓库所有者裁决；在裁决前，本页 §1/§3 就是唯一有效口径。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:133 b24213652ece4904ad2b88f1556115c6
msgid "Even if it were vendored, it would only be **read** for specific ideas (LADRC, HFI). It produces no comparison data and enters no test. When it disagrees with this page, the default is to distrust SguanFOC."
msgstr "即使将来 vendor，它也只用于 **人工阅读** 特定思路（LADRC、HFI），不产生比对数据、不进 CI；与它不一致时 **默认不信任 SguanFOC** 。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:138 dc82c752a8694d67a8f8f0ffbadc38da
msgid "_`5. Change rule`"
msgstr "_`5. 变更规则`"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:140 1cb5868adbc34f9e87fed537dd4a9b8c
msgid "Any change to a convention above (introducing per-unit, switching to generator convention, adding back-calculation to the PI) must change **this page first**, then the code, then the L2 reference traces (regenerated with :code:`offline_arbiter.py`) — and only then may it be committed. Reversing that order yields gates that are green while the convention is wrong."
msgstr "上面任何一条口径变化（引入标幺、改发电机惯例、给 PI 加 back-calculation），都必须 **先改本页** → 再改代码 → 再用 :code:`offline_arbiter.py` 重生成 L2 参考轨迹 → 最后才允许提交。顺序颠倒会得到“门禁绿了但口径错了”。"

#: ../../source/conventions.rst:144 2528d4ff70cc4611bbda572b9f139f68
msgid "A new comparison scenario appends a row to the *comparison slice* in section 1 and gets its own decision record in the PRD."
msgstr "新增比对场景时，在 §1 的“比对切面”追加一行，并在 PRD 里记一条决策记录。"
